          "angle": "unfolding",
          "marks": [
            "payer"
          ],
          "text": "The drain at {settlement} has stopped being blamed on {counterpart} and started being blamed on the hall that signed for it; the town has learned to read a treaty, and that is the change the seat cannot undo.",
